[PATCH] winq: contatori dello shim GL

---
 src/test-winq-glspia-conta.c | 180 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 src/winq-glspia-conta.c      | 176 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 src/winq-glspia-conta.h      |  58 +++++++++++
 3 files changed, 414 insertions(+)
